    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo lwa ng'wa Nasani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūntūma Nasani aje ū kūlī Daūdi, aho washika ūlūngalūnga nang'hwe; hūna ūng'wīla, “Mu nzengo nebe baalīmo banhū babīlī, ūmò nsabi, ūngī ng'habī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsabi walī na madaale mataale ga ng'holo na ng'ombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'habī walī atī na kīnhū, ūlū ītī kaana ka ng'holo kamò dūhū kakīma, ako walī wagūla gīkī nang'hwe apandīke. Walī akalang'hanile chiza no, kūshisha nose kūkūla hamò na a baana bakwe; yūbiza ng'holo yakwe. Nī shilīwa īsho walyaga ū wei nayo yalyaga; nū mu shikombe shakwe sha kūng'wela yang'welaga mo nayo; nose yītaga yalaala na mu makono gakwe. Nīyo ū kūlī we yalī yabiza gītī nshīke wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò ū nsabi ūpandīka ngeni, alīyo ūlemeelwa ū kūmeegeja ikūbī ū ngeni ūyo akangeniha ng'wenūyo ū kūfuma ū mu madaale gakwe a ga ng'holo nūūlū a ga ng'ombe. Ūja ūūkīsola ī ng'holo ya ng'habī wīsīnza ūmeegeja ī likūbī ū ngeni ūyo walī wangeniha wei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūbaka na būpelanu wa kūmpelanīla ū munhū ng'wenūyo; ūng'wīla ū Nasani, “Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA mpanga, gīkī ū munhū ūyo wagwītile ū mhayo gwenūyo igeleelilwe kūcha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama shing'wigeleelilwe wīlīpe ng'hangala inè ī ng'holo yenīyo, nguno wītile mhayo gwa wiboneeji būtaale no, ūbo būtī na shigongo!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nasani koolekecha būhūbi bo ng'wa Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Nasani ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyo hū ūlī bebe! Ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nakakwitīīla maguta ūbize ntemi wa Baisilaeli, nūkūpīja nū mu nkono go ng'wa Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nī kaya ya ng'wa so būgonzo nūkwinha bebe, na a bake ba ng'wa so būgonzo balī mu makono gako. Ī numba ya Isilaeli nī ya Yuda nī jene nakwinha bebe. Nīyo nūūlū ni shakīja ū kūkwigela ī shose shenīshi, ni nakwinha na shingī a higūlya yaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nibūlī lūūlū wagūdalahile ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA, wīta ya malofu gīko ū mu miso gakwe? Nguno ū Ulia ū Ng'hītī wamūlagile bo līlūshū, hūna ū nke wakwe ūnsola abize wako; ū wei ūmūlaga bo līlūshū lya Baamoni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū lūshū lūtīnga yaya ū mu kaya yako; nguno wanidalahile, ūnsola ū nke o ng'wa Ulia ū Ng'hītī gīkī abize nke wako.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Nakūkūgulumūkīja būbi būtaale no kūfuma ū mu kaya yako bebe ng'wenekīlī. A bake bako nakūbasola nang'winhe munhū ūngī, ūyo alī bbihī nang'ho no no no; akūlaala nabo a bake bako hape bo līīmi nyage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe wagwītile ū mhayo gwenūyū mu mbisīla, alīyo ū nene nakūkwītīla ū bebe bo hape kū būtongi wa Baisilaeli bose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Nasani, “Nang'hūbile ū SEEBA.” Nang'hwe ū Nasani ūg'wīla ū Daūdi, “Ū SEEBA wawīnjaga ū būhūbi wako, ūtūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī ū mu yenīyo wīyītile wabalugūlīlile nyango gwa kūdalaha a banishi ba ng'wa SEEBA, ū ng'wana ūyo wabyalīlilwe akūcha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Nasani wīnga ūja kaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana kūsaata na kūcha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūntūmīla būsaatu ū ng'wana ūyo nke o ng'wa Ulia akamyalīla ū Daūdi; ūsaata no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi wingīla mu kaya yakwe kūnombela ū ng'wana kūlī Mulungu, mu kūfunga na kūkeyula būjikū pe alaalile hasī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana ng'oma ba h'ikūlū būng'wegeela bīmīīla bbihī nang'hwe kūng'wikūmbīlīja abūūke, alīyo ūlema, nī shilīwa ūlema ū kūlya hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lwashika lūshikū lwa mpungatī ūcha ū ng'wana! A batūmami bakwe ū Daūdi bogoha ū kūng'wīla ī gīkī ū ng'wana wachaaga; biganika, “Ū ng'wana aho walī ataalī mpanga twalūgemaga ū kūyomba nang'hwe ū Daūdi, alīyo walī atūtūdegelekaga. Al'ī haha tūkūdūla kinehe ū kūng'wīla ī gīkī ū ng'wana wachaaga? A henaho lūūlū angū mmho ashikile nūūlū kwiyītīla mhayo gwabūbi gete!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Daūdi aho wababona a batūmami bakwe bakwiyombyaga mu kwihwehwetela, ūdeeba gīkī ū ng'wana wachaaga. Ūbabūūja, “Wachaaga ū ng'wana?” Būnshokeja, “Yaja chene, wazumalīka ng'hana!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūbūūka ī hasī aho waalī. Wahayūmala kooga, wibila maguta ūgalūcha nī shizwalo, ūja mu numba ya ng'wa SEEBA kūjūlamya. Hanuma ya henaho ūshoka kū ng'wakwe ūlomba shilīwa būng'winha ūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami bakwe būmūūja, “Nibūlī ūlīta mihayo īlī gīko? Ū ng'wana aho walī ataalī mpanga walūfungaga na kūlīla, alīyo ī haha aho waacha wabūūka waalya na shilīwa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshosha ūhaya, “Ū ng'wana aho walī ataalī mpanga nalūfungaga na kūlīla nguno naliganikaga, ‘Nani amanile? Hamo ū SEEBA adūgije kūnichīla shigongo ūneka ū ng'wana ikale mpanga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha īkī wachaaga, nafunge kūlwa nguno kī? Angū, nadūgije kūnshosha anishokele? Ū nene hū nakūja ū kūlī we, ū wei atūnishokela ū nene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Solomoni kūbyalwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Daūdi ūhooya nū nke wakwe mihayo yawiza gūzalabana ū moyo gwakwe, aho yika ī ng'holò ūlaala nang'hwe; ūbūūcha nda; ūbyala ng'wana ngosha būng'wilīka ī lina Solomoni. Ū SEEBA ūntogwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūtūma nhūng'wa mu nzīla ya ng'wa Nasani, gīkī ī lina lyakwe itanwe Yedidia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
